WEBVTT

00:00:03.688 --> 00:00:07.880
CANDY CANDY

00:00:10.237 --> 00:00:16.247
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:23.446
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.908
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:30.392
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:30.427 --> 00:00:35.817
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:43.226
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:43.438 --> 00:00:49.397
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:49.432 --> 00:00:55.839
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:56.126 --> 00:00:58.751
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:58.786 --> 00:01:02.212
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:10.312 --> 00:01:15.408
The person I met at the rose gates.

00:01:17.781 --> 00:01:20.148
Wow, what an incredible house!

00:01:25.304 --> 00:01:28.352
This house looks like it
came from a fairy tale!

00:01:29.035 --> 00:01:31.393
I'm sure the Prince is living here!

00:01:31.428 --> 00:01:32.464
Kurin, let's go in.

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:40.994
Candy was taken into the Leagan family.

00:01:41.431 --> 00:01:45.170
But two mean children, called Eliza
and Neil, awaited for her.

00:01:46.498 --> 00:01:50.288
However, Candy decided not to give in
to them, and to keep doing her best.

00:01:55.091 --> 00:01:56.609
Mother!

00:01:57.493 --> 00:01:59.078
What's up with this noise?

00:01:59.301 --> 00:02:02.195
Nice to meet you! I'm Candice White!

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.189
Oh no! I have to pump up some water!

00:02:39.627 --> 00:02:43.723
Huh? Oh yes, this is Leagan's house!

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.339
Wonderful!

00:02:49.796 --> 00:02:53.156
Hey, Kurin! Kurin, wake up!
It's a beautiful morning!

00:02:59.235 --> 00:03:01.414
Kurin, you'll oversleep again!

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:04.170
Okay, from today I'll be in high spirits!

00:03:13.955 --> 00:03:15.569
My prince.

00:03:17.373 --> 00:03:21.341
"You are prettier when you're smiling
than when you're crying."

00:03:24.377 --> 00:03:25.905
Candy's prince.

00:03:26.695 --> 00:03:28.179
I'm gonna work hard!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.389
Oh, Kurin, I'm so sorry!

00:03:40.206 --> 00:03:42.212
Funny thing happened yesterday.

00:03:42.556 --> 00:03:46.774
That new girl gave hell to
Eliza and Neal!

00:03:47.061 --> 00:03:49.428
I wonder what's her name.

00:03:49.768 --> 00:03:51.246
Her name is Candy.

00:03:51.627 --> 00:03:52.940
Good morning!

00:03:53.512 --> 00:03:55.127
How come you're here?

00:03:55.971 --> 00:03:58.237
You're a merry one, aren't you?

00:03:58.475 --> 00:04:01.766
I thought you fled this place
because of what happened yesterday.

00:04:02.699 --> 00:04:04.712
Me? Impossible.

00:04:04.747 --> 00:04:06.449
It didn't affect me one bit!

00:04:08.707 --> 00:04:10.076
That's funny!

00:04:10.111 --> 00:04:13.283
Candy, all of us are your friends.
Hang in there!

00:04:13.483 --> 00:04:14.402
Thanks.

00:04:14.562 --> 00:04:16.556
Can I help you somehow?

00:04:16.733 --> 00:04:22.478
You're miss Eliza's playmate, you don't
need to work together with the staff.

00:04:22.513 --> 00:04:26.510
I want to work! It's fun when
you do something with your hands!

00:04:39.007 --> 00:04:43.656
Why, isn't that my companion, doing the
job of a cleaning lady? It suits her!

00:04:44.407 --> 00:04:45.922
Good morning!

00:04:48.577 --> 00:04:51.189
Why don't you yourself do something
once in a while?

00:04:51.493 --> 00:04:54.085
You're supposed to call me "miss"!

00:04:54.647 --> 00:04:59.889
Well then, miss. I'm sure that you'll
be in a better mood while working!

00:05:05.448 --> 00:05:07.022
I won't give in to them.

00:05:30.926 --> 00:05:32.401
What's up with this?

00:05:33.668 --> 00:05:35.806
Why, you!
Missed.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.465
Wait!

00:05:42.266 --> 00:05:43.510
Stop that!

00:06:11.859 --> 00:06:13.094
Kurin, wait!

00:06:35.076 --> 00:06:36.170
Kurin!

00:06:41.061 --> 00:06:43.757
Horrible!
Mother!!

00:06:48.293 --> 00:06:51.341
Candy, you can't keep doing
these unecessary things!

00:06:51.931 --> 00:06:54.330
Unnecessary things?
I?

00:06:54.365 --> 00:06:57.783
That's right. You were called here to
become Eliza's playmate, am I correct?

00:06:57.784 --> 00:06:59.908
I don't want you to do anything else!

00:07:06.906 --> 00:07:09.193
What's that thing?

00:07:15.605 --> 00:07:17.469
Help me!

00:07:23.976 --> 00:07:27.174
Candy! Throw the raccoon
out of this house!

00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:29.694
But.. it was not Kurin's fault!

00:07:29.729 --> 00:07:31.545
You're not entitled to an opinion!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.118
I don't remember allowing you
to bring a raccoon with yourself!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:36.989
Y... yes.

00:07:58.926 --> 00:08:03.001
Now, go. This road will
take you back to Pony's home.

00:08:07.544 --> 00:08:10.078
Now, go! You have to go.

00:08:10.937 --> 00:08:13.262
It's for your own sake!

00:08:13.861 --> 00:08:15.330
Farewell, Kurin.

00:08:25.946 --> 00:08:27.580
You mustn't follow me!

00:08:46.087 --> 00:08:49.767
Kurin?
He's gone, after all.

00:08:56.816 --> 00:08:58.001
I give up.

00:08:59.646 --> 00:09:01.294
I'll have to chase you away then!

00:09:05.673 --> 00:09:07.163
Wait!

00:09:11.402 --> 00:09:15.480
Don't hate me for this, Kurin. Once you gnaw
through the rope, go back to Pony's home.

00:09:23.574 --> 00:09:24.959
Farewell, Kurin!

00:09:26.994 --> 00:09:29.649
Farewell, Kurin.
Take care.

00:09:49.743 --> 00:09:51.847
Kurin? I'm sorry, Kurin.

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:55.871
I just can't leave you behind.

00:10:07.032 --> 00:10:08.325
Come!

00:10:13.612 --> 00:10:15.323
Calm down!

00:10:15.964 --> 00:10:17.497
You can hide in there.

00:10:20.982 --> 00:10:23.993
Listen up, you can come to
my room when it gets dark!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.137
See you!

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.043
I'm not saying that...

00:10:38.521 --> 00:10:40.252
Hey! It's Candy!

00:10:41.235 --> 00:10:42.580
Hey! Candy!

00:10:42.643 --> 00:10:45.418
Did you really get rid of Kurin?

00:10:45.453 --> 00:10:46.289
Yes.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.778
That'd better not be a lie!

00:10:49.211 --> 00:10:50.444
It's true!

00:10:59.082 --> 00:11:02.258
Got back to them well!

00:11:03.195 --> 00:11:05.783
Now that's the way to
avoid an unpleasant situation.

00:11:07.587 --> 00:11:09.462
Candy? Are you here?

00:11:09.497 --> 00:11:10.753
Yes, come in!

00:11:12.075 --> 00:11:13.671
I have a letter for you.

00:11:14.072 --> 00:11:15.091
For me?

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:19.416
Something could have happened to it
if Madam or Eliza got to it first.

00:11:19.451 --> 00:11:20.932
So I brought it to you myself.

00:11:20.967 --> 00:11:23.722
Thank you!
It's from Pony's home!

00:11:25.609 --> 00:11:27.080
Dorothy, thank you!

00:11:27.645 --> 00:11:28.673
Candy!

00:11:35.571 --> 00:11:37.755
I got a letter from Pony's home!

00:11:42.103 --> 00:11:45.322
-That's Candy!
-She was with Kurin!

00:11:45.357 --> 00:11:47.722
That Candy... she didn't get
rid of her raccoon!

00:11:47.757 --> 00:11:50.827
She lied to us.
Let's tell mama about this!

00:11:50.862 --> 00:11:52.759
Let's wait out a bit.

00:11:52.794 --> 00:11:55.962
We could make better use of this
if we wait for a better moment.

00:11:55.997 --> 00:11:57.704
That's right...

00:12:00.338 --> 00:12:07.578
Okay, this disco font is bad enough, but
WHAT THE HELL IS WITH THE "WOOOOOO" SOUND

00:12:22.331 --> 00:12:24.950
Kurin, you want to read it
quickly, too?

00:12:24.985 --> 00:12:26.493
Hold on.

00:12:26.915 --> 00:12:28.377
It's sister Lane.

00:12:28.412 --> 00:12:31.650
"Candy, how are you?"

00:12:31.893 --> 00:12:34.436
"Have you already found your place
in your new home?"

00:12:34.471 --> 00:12:36.791
"Sister Pony is worried about you."

00:12:36.826 --> 00:12:38.859
"But I'm absolutely sure you'll
be okay."

00:12:38.894 --> 00:12:41.657
"I would like you to be happy."

00:12:41.692 --> 00:12:44.883
"Both sister Pony and I wish you that."

00:12:45.706 --> 00:12:47.722
This one is from sister Pony!

00:12:48.186 --> 00:12:52.180
"Candy, do you still pray before
going to bed?"

00:12:52.215 --> 00:12:57.898
"And don't drink too much water,
you'll upset your stomach."

00:12:58.562 --> 00:13:00.228
Oh, that sister Pony...

00:13:00.893 --> 00:13:03.409
Hey, even John sent me a letter!

00:13:04.181 --> 00:13:06.106
"Candy, how are you?"

00:13:06.307 --> 00:13:10.254
"Ever since you left, I decided
to start wetting my sheets again."

00:13:11.321 --> 00:13:12.878
John, you!

00:13:16.221 --> 00:13:20.430
"Candy, if something bad happens,
you can always return to Pony's home."

00:13:20.465 --> 00:13:26.560
"We haven't told sister Pony about it,
but all of us are waiting for your return."

00:13:26.595 --> 00:13:29.708
"If you do that, I'll stop wetting
my sheets!"

00:13:31.165 --> 00:13:34.654
I remember... all the good times
I had at Pony's home.

00:13:38.593 --> 00:13:42.174
Why doesn't my snowman look anything
like Annie's?

00:13:42.856 --> 00:13:44.626
I'll climb on its head!

00:13:52.158 --> 00:13:54.024
Candy, are you okay?

00:13:59.469 --> 00:14:00.858
They're coming this way!

00:14:01.175 --> 00:14:02.742
Move it!

00:14:07.844 --> 00:14:10.317
My snowman!

00:14:10.347 --> 00:14:12.379
Now you've done it!

00:14:13.584 --> 00:14:15.295
Tom, wait up!

00:14:25.872 --> 00:14:27.829
I'm going!

00:14:31.552 --> 00:14:32.620
Candy.

00:14:40.531 --> 00:14:43.025
Candy? Candy, where are you?

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:44.082
Candy!

00:14:45.396 --> 00:14:47.596
Candy, I won't forgive you for this!

00:14:50.647 --> 00:14:53.474
Thank you, everyone.
I'll do my best.

00:14:56.036 --> 00:14:58.884
Are these letters from Pony's home
so interesting, Candy?

00:14:59.736 --> 00:15:01.062
Neil, Eliza!

00:15:01.804 --> 00:15:03.594
What are you doing?
Give them back!

00:15:03.662 --> 00:15:05.029
I said give them back!

00:15:06.057 --> 00:15:07.254
Here, here!

00:15:08.839 --> 00:15:10.113
What's this?

00:15:11.473 --> 00:15:13.320
Give it back!

00:15:17.275 --> 00:15:18.076
This is...

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.055
Hey, Candy! Where did you steal this?

00:15:22.775 --> 00:15:24.247
Steal?!

00:15:25.047 --> 00:15:26.285
What's the matter?

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.020
A girl from Pony's home could hardly
afford to buy something like this!

00:15:29.055 --> 00:15:30.843
It's mine! Give it back!

00:15:31.706 --> 00:15:32.847
Get it!

00:15:33.235 --> 00:15:35.023
Don't give it back, Neil!

00:15:35.058 --> 00:15:35.730
Of course I won't!

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:37.368
I'm gonna take it!

00:15:37.369 --> 00:15:38.450
Give it back!

00:15:38.485 --> 00:15:39.290
I'm here!

00:15:42.628 --> 00:15:46.098
Candy, you want me to tell
mama about Kurin?

00:15:46.517 --> 00:15:50.996
Oh no! I completely forgot myself
when I got the letters!

00:15:55.685 --> 00:15:57.527
It's too late to hide now!

00:15:57.799 --> 00:16:01.086
We know that you're hiding
in the barn!

00:16:02.521 --> 00:16:05.542
If you want us to stay quiet,
hand this over!

00:16:05.577 --> 00:16:07.557
No! I'm not giving you that!

00:16:07.651 --> 00:16:09.499
Then, you're okay with us
telling to mama?

00:16:09.614 --> 00:16:14.497
Do whatever you want! I'll not let
you have it, no matter what! Give it back!

00:16:15.087 --> 00:16:16.390
Well then, you can throw
it into the lake.

00:16:17.387 --> 00:16:17.638
Okay.

00:16:20.169 --> 00:16:21.778
Throw it, throw it!

00:16:21.956 --> 00:16:23.710
Wait!

00:16:26.197 --> 00:16:27.148
Wait!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.783
Go get it!

00:16:53.108 --> 00:16:54.747
Look, she's crying!

00:16:55.199 --> 00:16:57.308
Give me my pendant!

00:17:00.559 --> 00:17:02.554
That's right, give it to her.

00:17:02.589 --> 00:17:05.720
In return, from now on you must obey
and do absolutely anything we order you!

00:17:05.755 --> 00:17:09.511
That's right! Get on your knees
and beg for forgiveness!

00:17:10.412 --> 00:17:12.121
You horrible people!

00:17:13.861 --> 00:17:15.224
Give it back!

00:17:19.297 --> 00:17:22.126
-Go to hell!
-You're fired!

00:17:29.643 --> 00:17:33.785
Anywhere...
I'll never return to this place!

00:17:43.284 --> 00:17:47.864
Sister Pony... sister Lane...!
I want to return to Pony's home!

00:18:19.928 --> 00:18:21.901
Don't cry...!
...miss freckle.

00:18:23.704 --> 00:18:26.252
Don't cry, miss freckle!

00:18:27.121 --> 00:18:30.082
You're cute when you smile!

00:18:40.259 --> 00:18:41.752
The prince from the hill!

00:18:47.223 --> 00:18:49.354
It's really my prince!

00:19:01.398 --> 00:19:03.992
Who is he?
Candy's prince?

00:19:16.998 --> 00:19:20.295
You really are cute when you smile!

00:19:21.036 --> 00:19:24.300
My prince said the same thing!

00:19:25.096 --> 00:19:28.893
"After all, you're cute when you smile."

00:19:31.615 --> 00:19:36.956
That's right... I mustn't cry.
That's not like me!

00:19:37.858 --> 00:19:39.604
Ow.

00:19:43.162 --> 00:19:46.272
He's gone...
But he was here just a moment ago...

00:19:46.509 --> 00:19:49.211
Until a moment ago...
Huh?

00:19:54.473 --> 00:19:56.427
Looks exactly like my pendant.

00:19:57.094 --> 00:20:00.636
That means that this person really
was my Prince!

00:20:02.903 --> 00:20:04.768
Aww, but the door is locked.

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:08.190
I wonder what kind of house is
behind these gates.

00:20:08.824 --> 00:20:11.520
I wonder if that lovely prince
lives in that place.

00:20:11.555 --> 00:20:16.342
I won't cry anymore. I promise.
Therefore, I would like to see you again.

00:20:16.377 --> 00:20:18.409
Please.
My prince.

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:28.241
Kurin, you found letters from Pony's home?

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:37.497
I really don't like her.
And she's late, too!

00:20:37.532 --> 00:20:41.999
I think that she might have gone back
to that Pony's home of hers!

00:20:43.681 --> 00:20:44.786
Look!

00:20:46.521 --> 00:20:50.025
Crybaby is coming!
"Give it back, give it back!"

00:20:52.432 --> 00:20:54.614
When are you going to return
to Pony's home?

00:20:54.649 --> 00:20:56.795
I'm sorry, but I won't be
returning to Pony's home!

00:20:56.998 --> 00:21:00.920
From now on, you can do just
about anything to me, I won't care!

00:21:10.518 --> 00:21:12.887
What happened to her?
She's weird.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:17.195
What is the meaning of this?
She really annoys me!

00:21:17.315 --> 00:21:20.009
Damn it, if it's come down to this,
I'll drive her out of this place for sure!

00:21:22.728 --> 00:21:24.932
They are exactly alike,
it's gone into their heads.

00:21:34.303 --> 00:21:35.440
Candy!

00:21:35.475 --> 00:21:36.586
Yes?

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:39.672
Where have you been until now?

00:21:40.433 --> 00:21:41.831
I'm sorry.

00:21:42.004 --> 00:21:46.199
Listen up! Stop making weird noises
and running around inside the house!

00:21:47.115 --> 00:21:48.493
Yes.

00:21:50.763 --> 00:21:56.215
It seems that Eliza hadn't told her about Kurin.
But I'm sure she'll want something in return.

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.468
But I don't care! I look forward
to any trouble they might give me!

00:22:05.666 --> 00:22:08.427
Just like the time I met him at
the hill above Pony's home,

00:22:08.462 --> 00:22:11.144
...the prince I met today had
those gentle eyes.

00:22:11.853 --> 00:22:14.905
Candy's heart was
overflowing with happiness,

00:22:15.139 --> 00:22:19.214
...for she was happy to have met
her wandering prince again.

00:22:20.332 --> 00:22:23.382
That's right!
I want to see you again.

00:22:30.501 --> 00:22:33.529
To be continued...

00:22:39.214 --> 00:22:47.960
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:22:47.995 --> 00:22:57.651
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki.

00:22:58.044 --> 00:23:06.773
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:23:06.808 --> 00:23:16.513
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:23:16.548 --> 00:23:24.956
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:23:24.991 --> 00:23:36.140
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:23:36.541 --> 00:23:47.116
Candy, candy, candy, candy.

00:23:48.624 --> 00:23:51.620
Next episode:
"Am I elegant?"

00:23:52.177 --> 00:23:56.214
Day by day, I'm getting used to
life with the Leagans.

00:23:56.249 --> 00:23:59.208
Everybody has been so kind, teaching me
all kinds of things I need to know!

00:23:59.775 --> 00:24:06.076
But Eliza and Neal don't want me in the
kitchen and around the staff.

00:24:06.842 --> 00:24:11.176
Otherwise, they threatened to tell
about Kurin, whom I'm hiding in the barn!

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:13.885
Next time on "Candy Candy",

00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:17.607
"Am I elegant?"
See you again!
